# Python leaves these beside the scripts in `.github/`. One was committed, so
# every run of `.github/tests/check-skill.test.py` on a different Python than
# the one that wrote it produced a diff nobody meant to make — including in CI,
# where the version is whatever `ubuntu-latest` ships. Found while working on
# `#21`, whose whole subject is a check nobody was reading the output of.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
